{"parse": {"title": "无烧-07", "pageid": 124107, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%97%A0%E7%83%A7-06\" title=\"无烧-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">无烧-07</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%97%A0%E7%83%A7-08\" title=\"无烧-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">无烧</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">07</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.AE.9D.E7.9F.B3.E8.95.B4.E6.84.8F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"宝石蕴意\">宝石蕴意</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 宝石蕴意</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Why Gemstones Matter</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianqian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianqian\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianqian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianqian.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianqian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianqian.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianqian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianqian.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianqian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕特尔的父亲：</div><div>找到了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他问得很随意，眼睛却紧盯着刚从矿洞里出来的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>没有，除了那些矿砂。你们可以拿去水里洗一洗，看看有没有收获。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>你说得对，这矿里确实没多少东西了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>显然，她所拥有的信任并不多，有好几双眼睛正盯着她，想从她身上找出线索。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们的瞳孔之中闪烁着异样的光，这样的神情，宝石猎人并不陌生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"521620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-521620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-521620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"521620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-521620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-521620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-521620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-521620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">异常的矿工：</div><div>我想，你一定是发现了什么东西，才会从矿洞出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>恐怕你要失望了——我什么都没找到。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>矿洞里的水太冷了，我建议你们缩短在里面待着的时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-501402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-501402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-501402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奇怪的矿工：</div><div>你找到宝石了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>我已经回答过这个问题了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她摊开了双手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>每个从矿洞出来的人都要接受这样的盘查吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>你们可以检查，但不要忘了，我仍然是你们的顾客之一。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>帕特尔的父亲看了她许久，神情像一条阴鸷的蛇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕特尔的父亲：</div><div>你在想什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>我在想——你们都不正常，真遗憾，这件事还需要我来告诉你们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>帕特尔死在矿里，没有一个人愿意去把他挖出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>就连你也不愿意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>如果你们肯救帕特尔，他或许还能活下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>但你们宁愿去下矿，即便你们已经找不到任何东西了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕特尔的父亲：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>抱歉，提一件已经无法挽回的事其实没有意义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>我太累了，我只是想休息一会儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人沉默了，目送她走向自己的车。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"521620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-521620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-521620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"521620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-521620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-521620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-521620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-521620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">异常的矿工：</div><div>不对！她一定找到宝石了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-313520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-313520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-313520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"521620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-521620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-521620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"521620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-521620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-521620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-521620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-521620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">异常的矿工：</div><div>她一定找到蓝宝石了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>毫无依据的一声惊吼，所有本就紧绷的神经在此刻断了弦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>离车只有几步之遥，宝石猎人的速度突然变快，一下窜进了车里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-501402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-501402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-501402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奇怪的矿工：</div><div>该死的！抓住她！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕特尔的父亲：</div><div>都让开！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他找到了枪，车已经发动，他双眼血红，看着车在沙地上甩出一个弧度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>沙尘弥漫，遮蔽天空。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>砰！手指扣动扳机，一颗颗子弹飞离了枪管。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_bg_03.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_bg_03\"><img alt=\"3_2_bg_03\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/Cg-3_2_bg_03.png/600px-Cg-3_2_bg_03.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/Cg-3_2_bg_03.png/900px-Cg-3_2_bg_03.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/Cg-3_2_bg_03.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_bg_03.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640916.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-640916.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640916.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640916.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-640916.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640916.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-640916.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640916.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>啊！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>车厢摇晃，惊叫声响彻车厢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-640912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-640912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-640912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>阿黛拉，你在干什么？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>我的胳膊好像被打了一枪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640918.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-640918.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640918.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640918.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-640918.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640918.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-640918.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640918.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>你到底什么时候可以消停点？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>抱歉，费利西安。现在不行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>我们现在正被追杀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>车后枪声四起，擦着车窗和轮胎飞过去，她们可以分明听见子弹飞行的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-640920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-640920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-640920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>谁让你这么玩命的？死了的话……一切就都没了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>矿区的人没有理智了，任何找到宝石的人都会被他们杀掉，钱对他们已经不重要了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>他们原本就贪婪，“暴雨”扭曲了这份贪婪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>真是幸运，我在巴黎当了一阵子司机，我没想到有一天我会这样逃命。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>好吧——其实我有想过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她自顾自地、突兀地笑了起来，中弹的手臂汩汩流血。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-640912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-640912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-640912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>阿黛拉，你自己丢了小命没关系，可别连累我！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>费利西安，你也差点死过，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>也许我也会有这样一天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她猛打了一下方向盘，车后的枪声正在远去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>但不是现在，我觉得我的心跳还远远不够快。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_2_bg_hean.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_2_bg_hean\"><img alt=\"2_2_bg_hean\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/Cg-2_2_bg_hean.png/600px-Cg-2_2_bg_hean.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/Cg-2_2_bg_hean.png/900px-Cg-2_2_bg_hean.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/Cg-2_2_bg_hean.png/1200px-Cg-2_2_bg_hean.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313525.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/HeadIconSmall-313525.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313525.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313525.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/HeadIconSmall-313525.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313525.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/HeadIconSmall-313525.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313525.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>但愿我不会只剩下一条胳膊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她过滤了一些清水，洗净了伤口周围的血迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>用火烧烫了刀刃，她咬住衣服，闭上眼睛，将手臂上的子弹取了出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313525.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/HeadIconSmall-313525.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313525.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313525.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/HeadIconSmall-313525.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313525.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/HeadIconSmall-313525.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313525.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>……呃！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313526.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-313526.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313526.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313526.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-313526.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313526.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-313526.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313526.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>不知道曾祖父有没有这样过。听我老妈说过，他的经历要比这可怕多了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313529.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-313529.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313529.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313529.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-313529.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313529.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-313529.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313529.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>不过拿破仑会记得他的名字……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她咬住绷带的一头，为自己包扎好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640918.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-640918.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640918.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640918.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-640918.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640918.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-640918.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640918.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>你现在觉得很骄傲吗，阿黛拉？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>听到这句话，面色苍白的宝石猎人有片刻沉默。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>我只是觉得一切和我想象中的都不一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>这就是冒险吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>为了寻找一颗稀有的宝石。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小龙避开她的伤口，攀上她的肩膀，它张开嘴，将石头吐了出来，累得气喘吁吁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一颗锥形的无烧原石，宝石猎人抬起手，透过天光仰望着它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313525.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/HeadIconSmall-313525.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313525.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313525.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/HeadIconSmall-313525.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313525.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/HeadIconSmall-313525.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313525.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>……只有宝石才有意义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313526.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-313526.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313526.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313526.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-313526.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313526.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/74/HeadIconSmall-313526.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313526.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>但是，“暴雨”已经改变了它的意义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313525.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/HeadIconSmall-313525.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313525.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313525.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/HeadIconSmall-313525.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313525.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/HeadIconSmall-313525.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313525.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>我的先辈，我的曾祖父，我的父母，在这样的世界里，他们所有人的故事都不再适用了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>我们不再需要追逐宝石了。这件事不会被记住，也不再被传颂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">灰调蓝：</div><div>我想知道，迷失也是命运的走向之一吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她喃喃道，语气中带着哀伤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>水晶球发出光辉，一位与命运息息相关的人传来消息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>阿黛拉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>“暴雨”将至。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "无烧-07"}}